Data notice: the surveillance figures in data/ and public/data derive from the
Taiwan CDC (衛生福利部疾病管制署) "臺灣抗生素抗藥性監視年報" annual reports in raw/,
which remain the property of their publisher. Cite the original reports when
reusing the numbers. Provisional model datasets (antibiotic use, HAI, GLASS
comparison) are estimates and are marked as such in every file.
